              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azobona ibara, ūhāririza uwamuremye, kand’ ar’ akajo mu tujo two kw isi! Mbeg’ ibumba ryobaza ūrikw araribumba, riti Har’ ico wobumba? Cank’ igikorwa ukora covuga kw ata maboko ufise? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azobona ibara, ūbaza se, at’ Ubgo wotera inda? akabaza nyina, at’ Ubgo wotwara inda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 41:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.64.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "64:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, Uwera wa Isirayeli, Umuremyi wiwe, ati Mbega murambaza ibizoza? Murangaba ku vy’abahungu banje n’ igikorwa c’amaboko yanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 2:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.27.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 27:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jewe naremye isi, kandi ndayiremerakw abantu; ni jewe nibambiye amajuru n’amaboko yanje, kand’ ingabo z’inyenyeri zose zo kuri yo ndazigaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 41:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "52:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jewe mpagurukije Kuro mu bugororotsi, kandi nzororanya inzira ziwe zose; ni we azokwubaka umurwa wanje, kandi ni we azorekura abantu banje bānyazwe, adahongewe cank’ adahērewe, ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
