            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, at’ Abakozi ba Egiputa n’abadandaza ba Etiyopiya n’abagabo barebare b’i Sabe bazoza bagukomere amashi, bazoba abawe, bagukurikire, bazoza bari mu minyororo, bakwikubite imbere, bagutakambire, bati N’ukuri Imana iri muri wewe, kandi nta yindi iriho, nta yindi Mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
